			<tr><th id="4">カメノコテントウ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/tentomushi013.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/tentomushi013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tentomushi014.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tentomushi014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi014.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">他のテントウムシよりも一回り大きいテントウムシ。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/tentomushi015.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/tentomushi015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi015.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tentomushi016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tentomushi016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi016.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/tentomushi017.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/tentomushi017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi017.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">裏側から見ると、鞘翅（さやばね）が広がっていることがわかります。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/tentomushi018.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tentomushi018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi018.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/tentomushi019.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/tentomushi019_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi019.jpg" --></a><a href="img/tentomushi020.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tentomushi020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi020.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">&nbsp;</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/tentomushi021.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/tentomushi021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi021.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">手に取ってみるまで、てっきりカラバリかと思っていました。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="5">カプセル・梱包</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/tentomushi003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/tentomushi003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi003.jpg" --><a href="img/tentomushi001.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/tentomushi001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/tentomushi/img/tentomushi001.jpg" --></a></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">カプセルの台座以外の不要部分はクリアレッド。<br />
				<br />
				本作の何が嬉しいかって、最初から組み立て済みなんですよね。<br />
				脚が6本ある昆虫は結構、組み立てが大変なので・・・。</td></tr>
